WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
TACTICIAN: your earned pet, a different fighting style.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Focus builds energy and a shield. Your trained Signature now costs less.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Use Signature after Focus to Weaken the opponent.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Repeat the sequence. Every third focused Signature activates Master Plan.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Try this build in Training. Earn permanent equipment with Math Points. Reset talents free between battles.
